[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://unit_standard_material_limiter_lit"]

; What it holds: a StandardMaterial3D with a normal map and anisotropy on a ground and a sphere, under a shadowed sun and a
; colour ambient light, in a project whose screen-space roughness limiter has amount 1.0 and limit 0.6. They draw through Godot's
; generated shader and the lit scene template (?litSurface=nodes), which reads the project's limiter.
; Every other material golden draws the classic path, so only this one shows a regression in these features on the node path.

[ext_resource type="Texture2D" path="res://normal-bumps.png" id="1_normal_bumps"]

